+    /** The bug this pins: the clock stamped its OWN mount, so switching surface
+     *  tabs — which unmounts the row and mounts it again on the same turn —
+     *  reset a 40s turn to "0s" in front of the trader. The owner of the row
+     *  knows when the turn began; the row must count from that. */
+    it('counts from the turn’s start, so a remount does not restart the clock', () => {
